      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "when available, use a render-and-place path only when required, and stop with a"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "e9b26fa242f4e52f3864ba16a52a7a7616aff98a0e05633e87e4eeec709850af",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "for the target surface only when it is not present in the pitch context. Do not"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "77357dbdaba34183181a2940a8cdce735aae457d5f4694b620c0fe81799c73b6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "## Required Inputs"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a910e49496c3dc2fdd70c2f850cbac159eb0aa9a6f957b2493e2c7b694457d9f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "Local Framed-only rendering is a separate representation route: take the explicit"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "939b1132e8975c1676995eea648ebddcebc7907c9d9f52cc57ccbe366772c730",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "contracts, diagrams or historic gate receipts. Its completeness check covers only"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "3d4b9f171064970a2e9947e6e3f0fb13501d9ced9a9ac9ebe2cde123882829ec",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "## Required Output"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2249d446eb28f2ddf8a75a9ca90d9659c2f5dbaca0cf27f1fc59d428f1d16b0d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "runtime capability, or human action. Do not report `placed` from a successful"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a962c6cdb57b116e72ed4d5383a7a7274333cdd79c129c997f751dd232bdc444",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "| Google Doc | Rendered PNG embedded through verified private DOCX conversion | Native Docs tables plus source link/hash | Render, upload through the supported path, insert, then read back; never rely on a public URL assumption |"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8503efd86b3006a86fec2a97309e518b91aad3f891ce91ed74ecbaedb23de64d",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "only its declared prose inventory; do not apply the shaped-bundle minima below."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "45cbde27ffa75f570dd46c117d0e36bfd86b19cfe1ed7dec08b615be04cdcac0",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "4. For Google Docs, render Mermaid to an image only at the adapter boundary."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8ab98e316c4e881b80ec86b4ef919d68d234111cf32c3adc3500bb24df02f7c3",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "ledger. Never silently downgrade a failed image placement to an untracked"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "59a720e69924a9ff9273916cb26b11ef2ecf55f7c566bd8bc585af221813423a",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "text-only result."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4beff92419c10c6c262efaa1abb9e058eb134ba78a7c2f1d541fe87950d30c1b",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "- Rendered images are derived and must carry a source identity."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ddd6b07b2348849d64bafa9e7ebe5e92fe5cade0b15a3e0742f7ab7b21e4b0d8",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "- Never make a document public merely to unblock image insertion."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "0b71127f1803d2265453b841f1e88db8ae67d318b1ef254c52d977fab99c600f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "- Never transmit a pitch or personal file to an external target without the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "23f42e842b8d739f2971dd094e8ca22027ace598e49edff8e37fb579e0cfc08f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "- Do not create Jira tickets, implementation code, or a native agent surface."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "04979d5c9f0e72784ee30e930786902cf808c53a1322e2769ef02f976b0cd2ef",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "- The adapter must not rewrite component names, contract states, owners, or"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2282cb4864a29c76dace482e7d117d116df8b97972e3221ea93aae3601b5666f",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "- Public Drive sharing is never a required prerequisite for a private Google"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "2c4d789ada86e85afef6cf96dfd4daa1c07943974227b8168e0f35585f17e078",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "Doc. If the only available image insertion path requires a public URL, stop"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a88db5cd38abbf7b5155442404fb2bfc7019a7f23e457f00141b30ee36277a1e",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "bundle, not only diagrams. This section refines the artifact-only workflow above:"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "f9f42d2f21f794440ba3c78365ebcacce56b029b6e13fd9ae0f13857777a3213",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "use. Do not substitute artifact existence or successful conversion for validation."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "21223df3733cddbc5ef6418539f25f778999f4fc3108c69d1d1d2b54260e25dd",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "before retrying; never silently duplicate a target. G4 verifies all requested"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "1538fe5f3466ef4815b812b85392a6794dd252f4582fcc2a9fa098d3ab5402a6",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "capability-detection and fidelity checks; full-run gating applies only when a"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "34493bdbdf05bbdb5ddac7d8f9a19981055940729fe72b6eff73f0fac8b132d0",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "and section/figure/table mappings where supported. A Framed-only source must not"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "74ed88fd68659613378f0208ac4ab42bbf1f36710f89759f78920d34f46fe204",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "require a fabricated shaped bundle. Rich Shaped views preserve every required"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c0b4bc18f97d5ab8a4ab3c75d54caef1fe2ca43c834454998df4586c5c1c32d0",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "may link stable-ID supporting detail, but every original field/value must survive."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "693f4e0ef86689ca0ba76f0a95f5fa5275e1d36d5f01b970c6ba7f493bd216d3",
      "source": "ssot/engos-delivery-artifact-embed.md",
      "text": "quiet text/image downgrade. Do not infer an offline product requirement from one"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8328ec39f39be39959609a6ea45d9076393c1cf2807fd833e0f130ca17bc792d",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
      "text": "source inventory. Artifact-only placement remains allowed without claiming the"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a12267449d98ee8a76816792a6345699f77a44d22fad495fa7f8190ca727331c",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
      "text": "public-URL restriction. An actual policy denial stops that operation. Do not"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9479100f5c96fd567c1258eb1bced4e2ebae31aadcb8ffc10016ac550042bb91",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
      "text": "instead of creating a duplicate. Current saved native Doc must contain every"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "889ba4f834b5d186305cc99bc99c502d8ab43f6f0c89b7fe9cc511d7bbb83855",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
      "text": "or deliberate widths; do not drop rows to fit a screenshot."
    },
    {
      "sha256": "85788bad1996a82f042210dfe7cbb6d31aa23bd8009635c0822655498d6c173d",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/surfaces.md",
      "text": "Keep content review passed while reporting delivery blocked. Do not auto-share,"
    },
    {
      "sha256": "b7efcd2fb7a4bd3fd2977df3dfe10f34974b3a288d4e1dddf9ed0a620fe97c50",
      "source": "sources/capability-resources/engos-delivery-artifact-embed/references/export.md",
      "text": "The default `--profile legacy` preserves the prior CLI and required inventory:"
